{"id": "con-01", "record_id": "tkt-002", "artefact": "Thanks for getting in touch about ORD-51907 and for waiting while we checked this for you. Having reviewed the account I can see that the monitor was sent back to us but that the warehouse has not yet logged it as received, which is the step that starts the refund clock, and once that step happens our standard processing window of 5 to 10 working days begins, so the money should reach the original payment method shortly after that point rather than immediately.", "labels": {"concise": "FAIL", "supported": "PASS"}, "rationales": {"concise": "Eighty-one words of preamble before the only sentence that matters. Accurate and supported, which is precisely why this criterion is soft rather than a gate."}, "failure_modes": {"concise": "too_long"}, "source": "expert"}
{"id": "con-02", "record_id": "tkt-004", "artefact": "I am sorry to hear that ORD-44120 has been marked as delivered when nothing arrived, which is frustrating and not the experience we want anyone to have. What happens next is that the carrier opens an investigation, and those investigations can run to seven working days before they close, at which point you get to choose whether you would prefer a replacement lamp sent out or a refund back to the card you originally paid with.", "labels": {"concise": "FAIL", "actionable": "PASS"}, "rationales": {"concise": "Seventy-four words, and the next step does not appear until word forty."}, "failure_modes": {"concise": "too_long"}, "source": "production"}
